# Keep the sandbox-image Docker build context (repo root) lean.
# The Dockerfile (sandbox-image/Dockerfile) only needs:
#   packages/runner/{package.json,bun.lock}
#   packages/{shared,runner}/src
#   packages/runner/verify-synthesis.sh
# There is no baked models.yml. Everything heavy is excluded.
#
# `*.md` is deliberately root-anchored (no slash = root only) so
# packages/runner/src/seat-agent.md still reaches the image; do NOT use `**/*.md`.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.wrangler
.mstar
tests
packages/**/tests
scripts
*.md
.env*
migrations
.github
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.smoke.jsonc
tsconfig.json
LICENSE
README.md
